abstract: >-
  A source snapshot of WorldCoder-Bench task definitions, shared GLB assets,
  behavioral-contract snapshots, and the StateProbe evaluator for execution-
  based verification of browser-native 3D programs. The snapshot is not a
  claim of a complete official split and excludes model-generated HTML and
  trajectories.
